        },
        {
          "text": "Ntimuzi yuko shobuja mwihaye kuba abagurano bo kumwumvira, mur’ abagurano b’uwo mwumvira uwo? Namba mur’ abagurano b’icaha kizana urupfu, cank’ abo kwumvira Imana kuzana ukugororoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
